"\r\n"
"4. **Tests ausf\xc3\xbchren**\r\n"
"   ```bash\r\n"
"   cmake --build build --target NeuroCoreTests\r\n"
"   ctest --test-dir build\r\n"
"   ```\r\n"
"   Sofern JUCE korrekt eingebunden ist, laufen alle Unit-Tests durch.\r\n";

